     2	
     3	## Results
     4	
     5	Two requested wording improvements applied to existing start-task preparation review and Flywheel handoff. Manual previous-text absence/current-text uniqueness controls PASS. Consumer main path: green regressions without artifact/outcome correspondence do not establish acceptance. Adjacent path: separate defect-sensitive acceptance may establish outcome even while regressions stay green. Flywheel review of a later amendment requires evidence or unresolved disposition; one completed child cannot establish integration. These are text interpretations, not observed agent effectiveness.
     6	
     7	One offline replay ran: two exact original command probes from f98ad1d9, two repaired command forms and historical script files from811d5823, plus empty/trivial/missing controls. Current lint_probe classified all7 as expected: original inline commands refused at -c; repaired file commands accepted; invalid controls refused. No inherited command executed. The script reconstructs only required historical files in a temporary fixture. Inputs and hashes are nonempty and recorded.
     8	
     9	## Recommendation and limits
    10	
    11	Existing jog_run.lint_probe takes tokens[1] as the script path; swarm_preflight.eval_probes instead runs a shell command and maps return status. A surgical follow-up should reconcile supported command forms or explicitly refuse unsupported forms consistently at preparation, with preserved malformed/trivial/missing rejection. Do not simply exempt all option-looking tokens or claim that lint acceptance establishes semantics. No runtime fix implemented here; separate idea spike owns that decision and heuristic false-positive study. No unlazy runtime imported, no new suite/registry/gate/hook.
    12	
    13	Prior-art search found related glossary1407, admission522, preparation1439/1296 and outer-loop1386/1400; none is the requested narrow instruction + retained-input replay or explicit gate-lint exploration. Historical/14-day recurrence trend remains unknown. Lessons: NO_ENTRY; one replay supports a known compatibility observation, not an effectiveness claim.
